1783
00:00:01,783 --> 00:00:05,029
Crossing high mountains and deep valleys

5390
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:08,596
A ninja's body like a plane, flying freely in the sky

8848
00:00:08,848 --> 00:00:12,281
Honest and kind, Hattori-kun brings joy to all

12435
00:00:12,435 --> 00:00:15,615
With round open eyes and a tightly closed little mouth

15948
00:00:15,948 --> 00:00:19,349
Face concealed behind a mask, cheeks puffed up

19515
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:22,673
Catching villains with lightning-fast agility

22973
00:00:22,973 --> 00:00:26,440
Catching bad guys with strange tricks just like magic

26793
00:00:26,793 --> 00:00:29,819
Speaking like poetry, polite and spirited

31753
00:00:31,753 --> 00:00:33,853
"Making Up for Mistakes"

40753
00:00:40,753 --> 00:00:42,779
Oh, Hattori-kun, I'm really sorry

42827
00:00:42,827 --> 00:00:44,586
Could you please go play outside for a bit today?

44627
00:00:44,627 --> 00:00:45,540
Okay?

45580
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,440
Why is that?

46480
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:49,061
Because the teacher is coming for a home visit today

49173
00:00:49,173 --> 00:00:52,259
Do you remember last time,
how badly you pranked the teacher?

52300
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,626
You can't really blame me for that

53667
00:00:53,667 --> 00:00:56,159
Back then I thought the teacher was always bullying you

56200
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,382
Right, but anyway, this time...

57422
00:00:57,422 --> 00:00:58,939
you must never be rude to the teacher!

58980
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:00,213
I understand

60316
00:01:00,316 --> 00:01:01,889
Alright, then you stay here

62586
00:01:02,586 --> 00:01:04,946
Big brother, are we just going to let it go like this?

65426
00:01:05,426 --> 00:01:07,574
If we ninjas of the Iga clan make a mistake,

67614
00:01:07,614 --> 00:01:09,242
we must find a way to make amends!

69282
00:01:09,282 --> 00:01:11,402
We can never just brush it off carelessly

71443
00:01:11,443 --> 00:01:13,548
Shinzo has a point

73589
00:01:13,589 --> 00:01:15,179
Alright, let's make up for our mistake!

75225
00:01:15,225 --> 00:01:18,038
Let's find a way to give Kenichi's teacher a warm welcome

81478
00:01:21,478 --> 00:01:22,864
This must be the place

84036
00:01:24,036 --> 00:01:25,319
Is anyone home?

86507
00:01:26,507 --> 00:01:28,000
Who is it, please?

88546
00:01:28,546 --> 00:01:30,553
I'm Kenichi's homeroom teacher

90640
00:01:30,640 --> 00:01:32,253
Ah, Teacher, please come in

93636
00:01:33,636 --> 00:01:36,014
Come in, Teacher, make yourself at home, please have a seat

96956
00:01:36,956 --> 00:01:38,638
Sorry for the intrusion

101503
00:01:41,503 --> 00:01:43,117
Teacher, is something wrong?

103237
00:01:43,237 --> 00:01:44,570
That's... really strange

104610
00:01:44,610 --> 00:01:46,790
Excuse me, is your front door an automatic door?

106831
00:01:46,831 --> 00:01:48,044
No, not at all

108170
00:01:48,170 --> 00:01:49,610
You're so humorous, Teacher

109650
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:50,841
Then that's really bizarre

110901
00:01:50,901 --> 00:01:52,112
Kenichi

112153
00:01:52,153 --> 00:01:54,000
Come out quickly, Teacher is here for the home visit!

114041
00:01:54,041 --> 00:01:54,739
Coming

114780
00:01:54,780 --> 00:01:55,618
Hello, Teacher

115659
00:01:55,659 --> 00:01:57,375
Teacher, please step up and have a seat

117683
00:01:57,683 --> 00:01:58,510
Alright

121958
00:02:01,958 --> 00:02:03,043
What on earth?

123084
00:02:03,084 --> 00:02:05,006
Why is a shadow taking my shoes?

125132
00:02:05,132 --> 00:02:06,874
Oh dear, is Hattori-kun playing tricks?

127111
00:02:07,111 --> 00:02:09,249
How could that be, Teacher? You must be seeing things

129290
00:02:09,290 --> 00:02:11,467
Hey, I clearly saw a shadow!

131777
00:02:11,777 --> 00:02:15,236
- Teacher, please come sit over here
- Hurry up... walk faster!

136502
00:02:16,502 --> 00:02:18,604
Hattori-kun, you promised me

138644
00:02:18,644 --> 00:02:20,089
that you wouldn't mess with him

140130
00:02:20,130 --> 00:02:21,623
I'm only being of service

141664
00:02:21,664 --> 00:02:23,200
No need for you to bother!

144080
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:25,610
Thank you so much, don't mention it

145650
00:02:25,650 --> 00:02:26,685
No need

146745
00:02:26,745 --> 00:02:29,372
Where did my good boy go? Let me go call him

150351
00:02:30,351 --> 00:02:31,632
No need to be polite

155070
00:02:35,070 --> 00:02:36,829
That's really weird

159706
00:02:39,706 --> 00:02:41,353
Aah, a ghost...

162072
00:02:42,072 --> 00:02:44,369
Shinzo, please, I beg you not to do this

164410
00:02:44,410 --> 00:02:45,670
Don't scare the teacher!

165711
00:02:45,711 --> 00:02:47,265
I didn't mean to scare the teacher

167306
00:02:47,306 --> 00:02:49,070
I was just peeking from the ceiling

169110
00:02:49,110 --> 00:02:51,590
But doing that will scare the teacher to death!

171630
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:52,604
Knock it off!

172645
00:02:52,645 --> 00:02:53,824
You two, listen up

173865
00:02:53,865 --> 00:02:55,538
Stay in the room and don't go outside!

175579
00:02:55,579 --> 00:02:57,110
Understood, Yan...

177458
00:02:57,458 --> 00:02:59,117
Oh, Kenichi

179157
00:02:59,157 --> 00:03:00,922
I'd like to take a look at your bedroom now

180963
00:03:00,963 --> 00:03:02,522
Please take me there, okay?

182916
00:03:02,916 --> 00:03:05,162
Kenichi, hurry up and take the teacher there

185784
00:03:05,784 --> 00:03:07,015
Teacher, please don't go

187056
00:03:07,056 --> 00:03:08,456
The room is very messy

188643
00:03:08,643 --> 00:03:09,757
That doesn't matter

189797
00:03:09,797 --> 00:03:11,569
I just want to see how your daily life is

191610
00:03:11,610 --> 00:03:13,871
- Come on, take me to see your room
- Yes, sir

195274
00:03:15,274 --> 00:03:18,037
Oh no, what if those two are in the room?

198313
00:03:18,313 --> 00:03:21,204
Teacher, my room is upstairs!

201520
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:24,643
I'm right next to you, why yell so loudly?

204925
00:03:24,925 --> 00:03:26,510
The teacher is coming, Big Brother

206550
00:03:26,550 --> 00:03:28,330
Kenichi told us that no matter what

208371
00:03:28,371 --> 00:03:29,983
We must not leave this place

210024
00:03:30,024 --> 00:03:31,702
But if we stay here...

211743
00:03:31,743 --> 00:03:33,155
We ninjas have a code

213196
00:03:33,196 --> 00:03:34,770
If we make a promise, we must keep it

214810
00:03:34,810 --> 00:03:36,189
That's true

216275
00:03:36,275 --> 00:03:38,231
Why be so strict?

219125
00:03:39,125 --> 00:03:41,565
Teacher, we've arrived, this is the room

221944
00:03:41,944 --> 00:03:42,849
Are you going in?

222890
00:03:42,890 --> 00:03:44,784
Of course I'm going in to see

225183
00:03:45,183 --> 00:03:46,928
Alright, let's head in then

231379
00:03:51,379 --> 00:03:52,733
Please come in, Teacher

232774
00:03:52,774 --> 00:03:55,338
Huh, you have such a big room all to yourself?

237770
00:03:57,770 --> 00:03:58,891
Is something wrong?

239191
00:03:59,191 --> 00:04:01,678
No... I just saw...

242250
00:04:02,250 --> 00:04:03,557
Just some trash on the floor

243830
00:04:03,830 --> 00:04:05,998
Kenichi, have you finished your homework?

248200
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,480
Oh dear, it's happening again

249521
00:04:09,521 --> 00:04:11,333
Ever since I walked in, I keep seeing illusions

251374
00:04:11,374 --> 00:04:13,440
I'm not mistaken, I really saw it!

253554
00:04:13,554 --> 00:04:14,708
How strange

255040
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:16,519
Oh dear, what are those?

256615
00:04:16,615 --> 00:04:17,955
I didn't get away in time!

258676
00:04:18,676 --> 00:04:20,531
Kenichi, why would you

260572
00:04:20,572 --> 00:04:21,800
Stick monsters on the ceiling like that?

261840
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:23,459
Do you think that looks good?

263543
00:04:23,543 --> 00:04:25,219
Oh, you're calling me a monster?

265706
00:04:25,706 --> 00:04:28,287
Sticking them on the ceiling saves space, you know

269008
00:04:29,008 --> 00:04:30,035
Come to think of it

270075
00:04:30,075 --> 00:04:31,941
The figures on the ceiling look pretty lifelike

272401
00:04:32,401 --> 00:04:34,701
I'm losing my grip, I can't hold on, oh no...

276810
00:04:36,810 --> 00:04:38,971
I feel like something is moving

279011
00:04:39,011 --> 00:04:40,682
Oh no... an earthquake is coming!

280723
00:04:40,723 --> 00:04:41,731
Quick, get out...

281772
00:04:41,772 --> 00:04:42,971
Don't say such crazy things!

283012
00:04:43,012 --> 00:04:45,104
If it were an earthquake, it'd be everywhere

287956
00:04:47,956 --> 00:04:50,966
I really feel like everything is shaking around us

291112
00:04:51,112 --> 00:04:53,256
-Teacher, hurry and go to the bathroom!
-I don't need to!

293406
00:04:53,406 --> 00:04:55,839
Teacher, does this drawing look good?

295880
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:58,121
Looking good on the surface is useless if it lacks depth

298400
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,413
Teacher, do you know how to play this?

303772
00:05:03,772 --> 00:05:05,858
Woah, all six sides in three seconds!

305898
00:05:05,898 --> 00:05:07,258
That's a world record!

307491
00:05:07,491 --> 00:05:08,737
I can't hold on, I've got no strength left

308857
00:05:08,857 --> 00:05:09,870
Teacher, look!

309911
00:05:09,911 --> 00:05:11,270
A pretty girl is walking by

311310
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:12,263
What?

312445
00:05:12,445 --> 00:05:13,871
I've got no strength left

316357
00:05:16,357 --> 00:05:18,754
-Oh no, Teacher!
-Don't worry, Teacher

318795
00:05:18,795 --> 00:05:20,213
Everything's fine now

320253
00:05:20,253 --> 00:05:22,350
Teacher, h-how are you feeling now?

322449
00:05:22,449 --> 00:05:24,349
By the way, what happened with the earthquake?

324503
00:05:24,503 --> 00:05:25,779
It wasn't an earthquake earlier

325813
00:05:25,813 --> 00:05:28,412
It was just a monster figure falling down

328646
00:05:28,646 --> 00:05:30,339
Oh, that monster?

330519
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:32,440
So where did you put it now?

332481
00:05:32,481 --> 00:05:33,525
I'm worried it's dangerous

333611
00:05:33,611 --> 00:05:34,786
In the closet

334827
00:05:34,827 --> 00:05:35,706
That's a relief

335746
00:05:35,746 --> 00:05:38,228
No point risking it falling on someone else, right?

338269
00:05:38,269 --> 00:05:39,358
Right

340355
00:05:40,355 --> 00:05:41,820
Teacher, I'm really sorry

341860
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:43,037
We barely hosted you properly

343078
00:05:43,078 --> 00:05:45,226
Don't mention it, I must take my leave now

347274
00:05:47,274 --> 00:05:50,041
Oh my, who polished my shoes so nicely?

351334
00:05:51,334 --> 00:05:53,980
I didn't expect Kenichi to be so sharp today

354021
00:05:54,021 --> 00:05:55,245
Good job, Hattori-kun!

355957
00:05:55,957 --> 00:05:57,849
Thanks for having me

361439
00:06:01,439 --> 00:06:02,693
That's really strange

362733
00:06:02,733 --> 00:06:04,839
Doesn't look like there's any hidden mechanism here

369102
00:06:09,102 --> 00:06:10,161
So strange

370501
00:06:10,501 --> 00:06:13,180
There are stickers, and even illusions, how bizarre

373220
00:06:13,220 --> 00:06:14,407
Bye-bye

374455
00:06:14,455 --> 00:06:16,527
Aah, I'm terrified!

376840
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,899
My service wasn't top-notch this time

378939
00:06:18,939 --> 00:06:20,620
So next time Teacher visits

380660
00:06:20,660 --> 00:06:24,255
I'll definitely step up my service, Yan...

388047
00:06:28,047 --> 00:06:30,552
"Shinzo Makes Things Worse"

396960
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:39,593
Kenichi, could you run an errand for me?

399633
00:06:39,633 --> 00:06:41,093
Would you?

401458
00:06:41,458 --> 00:06:42,292
Sure

403372
00:06:43,372 --> 00:06:44,573
Let me go!

406475
00:06:46,475 --> 00:06:48,042
Shinzo, wait a second

408082
00:06:48,082 --> 00:06:50,275
With Shinzo on the case, I can do anything!

410315
00:06:50,315 --> 00:06:52,092
Can you really do it, Shinzo?

412133
00:06:52,133 --> 00:06:53,567
Don't worry, I've got this!

419827
00:06:59,827 --> 00:07:01,648
What do you need me to buy?

423694
00:07:03,694 --> 00:07:05,948
Now, you're very careless

426934
00:07:06,934 --> 00:07:08,306
Look carefully, the things to buy...

428347
00:07:08,347 --> 00:07:10,806
are all written down here, just get what's on the list

431025
00:07:11,025 --> 00:07:13,852
That's simple, I'm setting off right now!

437381
00:07:17,381 --> 00:07:20,247
Where on earth are the grocery store and the fish market?

442585
00:07:22,585 --> 00:07:23,370
What's wrong?

443410
00:07:23,410 --> 00:07:25,564
You'd better not go, let me go instead

446177
00:07:26,177 --> 00:07:27,710
If you don't let me go...

448056
00:07:28,056 --> 00:07:29,556
Then I'm gonna cry!

450853
00:07:30,853 --> 00:07:33,254
Oh no, don't... don't cry

453295
00:07:33,295 --> 00:07:34,607
Oh, I give in

458023
00:07:38,023 --> 00:07:41,231
As long as I have a map, there's nowhere Shinzo can't go!

462608
00:07:42,608 --> 00:07:43,561
Shishimaru

463601
00:07:43,601 --> 00:07:44,873
I know what to do

469407
00:07:49,407 --> 00:07:50,807
Hey

471666
00:07:51,666 --> 00:07:52,613
Hey

473646
00:07:53,646 --> 00:07:56,127
I can go shopping all by myself now!

486867
00:08:06,867 --> 00:08:07,720
Hey

488186
00:08:08,186 --> 00:08:11,036
Listen up, I can go shopping all by myself now!

491903
00:08:11,903 --> 00:08:13,070
So troublesome

493156
00:08:13,156 --> 00:08:13,910
Hey

494056
00:08:14,056 --> 00:08:14,922
What is it?

495929
00:08:15,929 --> 00:08:18,629
Listen up, I can go shopping all by myself

499462
00:08:19,462 --> 00:08:22,609
What a good boy, didn't think you'd be so capable at your age!

502956
00:08:22,956 --> 00:08:23,936
Bye-bye!

512696
00:08:32,696 --> 00:08:34,329
Oh shoot, this time, oh shoot...

516856
00:08:36,856 --> 00:08:38,262
Oh no, I forgot!

521550
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:43,483
First, go to the grocery store to buy stuff

523523
00:08:43,523 --> 00:08:45,610
Which means... that way

526033
00:08:46,033 --> 00:08:47,013
That's right!

527433
00:08:47,433 --> 00:08:49,333
Huh? It's a dead end!

533183
00:08:53,183 --> 00:08:54,652
You're back already?

536050
00:08:56,050 --> 00:08:57,835
How come Shinzo is back so fast?

537876
00:08:57,876 --> 00:09:00,141
No good... I'll start over!

541679
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:04,070
This time I have to follow along

544824
00:09:04,824 --> 00:09:07,017
Yan...

548030
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:09,729
Hey, what's going on? Drive already!

549770
00:09:09,770 --> 00:09:11,247
Total gridlock, what's the holdup?

551288
00:09:11,288 --> 00:09:13,834
Drive already, you're blocking the way!

554094
00:09:14,094 --> 00:09:15,752
Hurry up and drive, move!

555793
00:09:15,793 --> 00:09:17,619
Shinzo really is trouble

557660
00:09:17,660 --> 00:09:19,367
He's bound to cause trouble sooner or later

561639
00:09:21,639 --> 00:09:23,752
Yan...

566932
00:09:26,932 --> 00:09:29,300
Alright, I'll draw an arrow first

569340
00:09:29,340 --> 00:09:30,441
There we go

578643
00:09:38,643 --> 00:09:40,270
What does this arrow mean?

580820
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:42,536
Let's draw a few more

588823
00:09:48,823 --> 00:09:50,183
You can't walk away!

590783
00:09:50,783 --> 00:09:51,707
I'm sorry!

598411
00:09:58,411 --> 00:09:59,423
Arrived at the grocery store!

599464
00:09:59,464 --> 00:10:00,741
Yes, welcome!

602039
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,725
The arrow points all the way here

603766
00:10:03,766 --> 00:10:05,220
What on earth is going on here?

605240
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:07,482
Maybe there's a closing-down clearance sale, huh?

607985
00:10:07,985 --> 00:10:09,206
Oh, honey!

609247
00:10:09,247 --> 00:10:10,500
A whole crowd just showed up!

610540
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:11,651
Come out and help quick!

611692
00:10:11,692 --> 00:10:12,765
Help me sell the stuff!

614058
00:10:14,058 --> 00:10:15,277
Give me some...

615584
00:10:15,584 --> 00:10:17,977
Give me some...

618018
00:10:18,018 --> 00:10:20,232
Wow, business is booming for this shop!

620565
00:10:20,565 --> 00:10:22,392
Next is the fish stall

622702
00:10:22,702 --> 00:10:24,061
Oh no, the map is gone!

624102
00:10:24,102 --> 00:10:25,902
This is really bad now

626202
00:10:26,202 --> 00:10:28,425
Shishimaru, hurry and put on a disguise!

628466
00:10:28,466 --> 00:10:29,836
Piece of cake

632652
00:10:32,652 --> 00:10:35,179
I want you to snatch the grocery basket from Shinzo's hands

635219
00:10:35,219 --> 00:10:37,178
And then head to the fish stall, got it?

662127
00:11:02,127 --> 00:11:03,752
I'm counting on you

665947
00:11:05,947 --> 00:11:08,165
Where did that map fall?

672410
00:11:12,410 --> 00:11:14,074
Don't run!

674973
00:11:14,973 --> 00:11:18,432
Don't run...

690388
00:11:30,388 --> 00:11:32,189
I didn't expect him to actually hit me

693335
00:11:33,335 --> 00:11:34,368
That really hurt

696205
00:11:36,205 --> 00:11:38,250
Ow, it hurts so much! Ouch, that hurts...

705315
00:11:45,315 --> 00:11:48,300
There's the fish stall, yay!

708765
00:11:48,765 --> 00:11:50,393
Mission accomplished!

713847
00:11:53,847 --> 00:11:56,541
Shishimaru, I'm so sorry you had to take a beating

716582
00:11:56,582 --> 00:11:57,967
Thank you for your business!

723685
00:12:03,685 --> 00:12:06,538
I can go shopping all by myself!

728205
00:12:08,205 --> 00:12:11,699
I can go shopping all by myself, yay!

732225
00:12:12,225 --> 00:12:13,032
Yay!

733072
00:12:13,072 --> 00:12:16,308
I can go shopping all by myself!

737370
00:12:17,370 --> 00:12:20,225
He has no idea how much effort I put into helping him

740265
00:12:20,265 --> 00:12:22,188
Even if I was the one who suffered

745876
00:12:25,876 --> 00:12:27,390
"The Uninvited Guest"

755707
00:12:35,707 --> 00:12:38,100
Yan...

769536
00:12:49,536 --> 00:12:51,527
I'm covered in mud!

772186
00:12:52,186 --> 00:12:54,893
Damn it, splashing me like this and not even apologising?

777832
00:12:57,832 --> 00:12:59,985
That car is so rude!

783367
00:13:03,367 --> 00:13:05,310
Oh, that's the car!

785350
00:13:05,350 --> 00:13:06,990
Yeah, I recognise it too

787630
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:08,864
Please, have a seat

789091
00:13:09,091 --> 00:13:10,838
Thank you so much

791831
00:13:11,831 --> 00:13:14,054
We haven't seen each other in almost 20 years

794101
00:13:14,101 --> 00:13:16,135
It's so wonderful to catch up today

796175
00:13:16,175 --> 00:13:17,516
Has it really been 20 years?

797557
00:13:17,557 --> 00:13:18,961
May I ask who you are?

799026
00:13:19,026 --> 00:13:21,051
Oh, you don't even remember me?

801092
00:13:21,092 --> 00:13:22,459
Back when we were in primary school

802499
00:13:22,499 --> 00:13:23,945
We hung out and saw each other all the time

803986
00:13:23,986 --> 00:13:25,328
Oh, are you Kato?

807196
00:13:27,196 --> 00:13:29,196
No, think a bit harder

809276
00:13:29,276 --> 00:13:30,676
I'm so sorry

810776
00:13:30,776 --> 00:13:31,457
Who on earth...

811497
00:13:31,497 --> 00:13:33,735
I'm your classmate Yamamoto who lived next door

813776
00:13:33,776 --> 00:13:35,042
Oh, Yamamoto?

815381
00:13:35,381 --> 00:13:38,235
I remember now! What line of work are you in?

818345
00:13:38,345 --> 00:13:40,125
I'm in the safe business now

820165
00:13:40,165 --> 00:13:43,020
By the way, do you have a safe at home?

823060
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:45,069
Why would a regular house have a safe?

825495
00:13:45,495 --> 00:13:47,527
Your house is so big, you really should get one

827568
00:13:47,568 --> 00:13:48,956
Mom, make extra food!

828997
00:13:48,997 --> 00:13:50,137
Oh, got it

831683
00:13:51,683 --> 00:13:52,697
That's wonderful

834597
00:13:54,597 --> 00:13:57,291
Mom, is our food ready yet?

837331
00:13:57,331 --> 00:13:59,306
Wait a little longer

839346
00:13:59,346 --> 00:14:01,913
As soon as the guest leaves, I'll cook for you

842891
00:14:02,891 --> 00:14:04,018
How annoying!

844058
00:14:04,058 --> 00:14:06,031
That guest got me all filthy earlier

846072
00:14:06,072 --> 00:14:07,738
And now he's keeping me from eating!

847845
00:14:07,845 --> 00:14:09,260
Hattori-kun, is there any way

849300
00:14:09,300 --> 00:14:11,184
To make him leave right now?

854154
00:14:14,154 --> 00:14:16,055
Well? Do you have an idea?

856095
00:14:16,095 --> 00:14:17,521
Woah, do you really have a plan?

857561
00:14:17,561 --> 00:14:18,794
Of course I do

862822
00:14:22,822 --> 00:14:24,562
Shishimaru, what are you doing?

871004
00:14:31,004 --> 00:14:32,540
Shishimaru, that's so rude!

872580
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:34,331
Never mind... He must be really hungry

874371
00:14:34,371 --> 00:14:35,499
Just let him eat

875877
00:14:35,877 --> 00:14:37,057
Make sure you don't choke

877097
00:14:37,097 --> 00:14:38,637
Here, have some sake, okay, here...

880389
00:14:40,389 --> 00:14:43,203
I believe this dog
must come from a noble breed

883283
00:14:43,283 --> 00:14:44,588
He was born in Iga

884628
00:14:44,628 --> 00:14:46,432
Iga? Iga is the ninja homeland

886472
00:14:46,472 --> 00:14:48,285
Dogs from there must be worth a fortune

888326
00:14:48,326 --> 00:14:49,438
To be honest

889479
00:14:49,479 --> 00:14:51,504
He's our family's priceless treasure

891557
00:14:51,557 --> 00:14:53,696
No matter how much money is offered, we won't sell him

893737
00:14:53,737 --> 00:14:56,878
Plus he's a huge eater, so he's really not easy to keep

899164
00:14:59,164 --> 00:15:00,468
I've had my fill of food and drink

900509
00:15:00,509 --> 00:15:02,320
Oh dear, Shishimaru, what on earth are you doing?

902361
00:15:02,361 --> 00:15:03,695
After all this time, he still hasn't left?

903736
00:15:03,736 --> 00:15:05,380
Shishimaru is so simple-minded

905420
00:15:05,420 --> 00:15:08,180
He thought if he ate all the food, the guest would leave

908867
00:15:08,867 --> 00:15:10,442
How frustrating!

910948
00:15:10,948 --> 00:15:12,255
Who could that be?

915250
00:15:15,250 --> 00:15:17,643
Looks like that guy's wife

917686
00:15:17,686 --> 00:15:19,346
Wow, she looks really mean!

919471
00:15:19,471 --> 00:15:22,824
Kenichi, I've thought of a good way to drive him away

935153
00:15:35,153 --> 00:15:37,464
I must definitely be drunk

938028
00:15:38,028 --> 00:15:40,827
Yan...

943450
00:15:43,450 --> 00:15:44,743
Yamamoto, are you all right?

944976
00:15:44,976 --> 00:15:46,802
May I use the restroom?

948688
00:15:48,688 --> 00:15:49,874
I want to leave!

950758
00:15:50,758 --> 00:15:52,020
I want to leave now

952190
00:15:52,190 --> 00:15:53,554
Yamamoto, I'm really sorry

953595
00:15:53,595 --> 00:15:55,888
It must be a prank played by Kenichi's friend

956561
00:15:56,561 --> 00:15:57,875
Hattori-kun! Kenichi!

957915
00:15:57,915 --> 00:15:59,391
Come out and apologize right now!

959431
00:15:59,431 --> 00:16:00,620
I know I was wrong

960660
00:16:00,660 --> 00:16:02,434
Well, it's getting late, so I should get going

962587
00:16:02,587 --> 00:16:04,260
Yamamoto, why don't you stay the night?

964300
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:06,020
Drunk driving is illegal, you know

966060
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:08,092
Yes, I know, but...

968219
00:16:08,219 --> 00:16:10,082
All right, since I've already bothered you

970123
00:16:10,123 --> 00:16:11,203
I'll make myself at home then

975144
00:16:15,144 --> 00:16:17,730
The kids in this house are seriously weird

977770
00:16:17,770 --> 00:16:19,330
I'd better get out of here as soon as possible

983836
00:16:23,836 --> 00:16:26,843
It's all bulky junk, not worth a dime

991345
00:16:31,345 --> 00:16:32,485
That's right

992705
00:16:32,705 --> 00:16:35,677
This dog is a priceless treasure, I can't leave him behind

999536
00:16:39,536 --> 00:16:41,963
Kenichi, wake up

1011321
00:16:51,321 --> 00:16:53,607
Yan...

1014093
00:16:54,093 --> 00:16:55,060
This is bad!

1015101
00:16:55,101 --> 00:16:57,247
Thief! Stop right there!

1018377
00:16:58,377 --> 00:17:00,060
Help!

1020943
00:17:00,943 --> 00:17:02,397
What's going on?

1024764
00:17:04,764 --> 00:17:05,838
Help!

1030483
00:17:10,483 --> 00:17:13,195
Yan...

1036413
00:17:16,413 --> 00:17:17,869
Yan...

1041763
00:17:21,763 --> 00:17:24,137
Hey, don't run! Stop!

1052368
00:17:32,368 --> 00:17:33,741
How could you treat a guest like that?

1053782
00:17:33,782 --> 00:17:35,428
Big bro, what's going on?

1060719
00:17:40,719 --> 00:17:41,811
It's him!

1062096
00:17:42,096 --> 00:17:43,308
What's going on?

1063349
00:17:43,349 --> 00:17:45,117
I found out he stole someone's car!

1065297
00:17:45,297 --> 00:17:46,135
No way!

1066176
00:17:46,176 --> 00:17:48,389
Yamamoto and I grew up playing together though!

1068430
00:17:48,430 --> 00:17:49,029
How is that even possible?

1069069
00:17:49,069 --> 00:17:51,380
You fell for his trick. He has a long criminal record

1071420
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:53,622
He specializes in impersonating people to burglarize houses

1074441
00:17:54,441 --> 00:17:56,268
No wonder when I first ran into him

1076308
00:17:56,308 --> 00:17:57,364
I had no memory of him at all

1077405
00:17:57,405 --> 00:17:59,605
Turns out I fell for his trick from the very beginning!

1080563
00:18:00,563 --> 00:18:03,667
Ah, you did a great job catching the thief, so you get a reward!

1085156
00:18:05,156 --> 00:18:06,370
We get a reward!

1086411
00:18:06,411 --> 00:18:08,060
Come on, you were totally drunk

1088100
00:18:08,100 --> 00:18:09,657
and asleep, you didn't contribute at all!

1089698
00:18:09,698 --> 00:18:11,669
You almost got kidnapped and didn't even know it!

1091709
00:18:11,709 --> 00:18:12,938
How do you qualify for a reward?

1092979
00:18:12,979 --> 00:18:14,335
No reward for you!

1095341
00:18:15,341 --> 00:18:16,547
I'm so sorry

1096588
00:18:16,588 --> 00:18:18,656
I feel so deeply ashamed
